llama-rs (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release with 16 workspace crates.
  * CLI and HTTP server frontends.
  * GGUF v3 parser, SIMD matmul, CUDA backend.
  * GUI/UX improvements: Enhanced keyboard navigation, visual design, and accessibility
    - Added comprehensive keyboard shortcuts for all major actions
    - Improved visual hierarchy with better spacing and typography
    - Enhanced accessibility with improved color contrast and touch targets
    - Better loading states and user feedback
    - Fixed context usage percentage calculation

